ADR-045 implements an adaptive macOS app icon while preserving the existing two-network identity. The Icon Composer source, generated catalog, ICNS fallback, Tauri override, and CI verification ship together because release runners default to Xcode 16.4. Review-only screenshots and machine-specific logs were deliberately excluded. Verification covered manifest integrity, JSON syntax, catalog appearance stacks, and arm64/x86_64 application bundles. Apple actool changes Assets.car bytes across identical compilations, so the manifest pins the reviewed output rather than asserting reproducible compilation.
